// Which of the game's adult heads are for elders.
//
// A head's name is shown under the panel in Create a Sim, and under the heads in the elder head picker,
// for example "c005ma_kaj". Capitals do not matter. One name covers every skin colour of that head.
//
//   "elder"  heads only for elders: they are taken out of Adult in Create a Sim, and are not given to a
//            child who grows up.
//   "both"   heads offered for adults and for elders: helmets, bald heads and others that suit either.
//
// Elders are offered the heads in both lists. If neither has one of a Sim's sex and skin colour, they
// are offered every adult head.
